# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID for Google Identity Services / Drive AppData sync
# Create a Web Application OAuth Client ID in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# Authorized JavaScript Origins to include in Google Cloud Console:
# - https://tempo.bot.nu (production - public TLD)
# - http://localhost:5180 (development - localhost is allowed)
# Note: Google rejects private/LAN domains (.lan, .local, raw IP addresses).
# For testing from other devices on your LAN, use https://tempo.bot.nu.
#
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
